A web app with a modern design based on MERN (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js) that will allow to build a dynamic and scalable application with the following requirements:

- A web app from where a user can create / add forms in a web format to the database;
- The forms will be assigned to various IDs: P IDs, V IDs, S IDs. A user (for a S ID) can create multiple forms and assign them to multiple V ID's (for each S ID) which are all part of a P ID (which contains mapping with all available V IDs);
- The web app can store multiple datasets based on the forms created for each S IDs (with multiple V IDs) assigned to a 1 x P ID. The web app can, of course store multiple P ID's with more S IDs with V IDs and forms assigned to each V ID. 
- In order to create forms for a V ID and S ID a user can have the option to create the form either by: a) selecting from the interface the option to create the form with one or multiple questions (type: predefined answer - user can input the answer for question of this type, or questions with free text - user will specify is this type of question, add the form name, form id, signature name of the person who completes the form, date) OR import the datasets for forms created (headers in SQL with ID's) from Excel, may be PDF files sometimes, or APIs in the future);
- A web app page where another user can add data to the forms created by the other user by respecting of course the V ID's and P ID's structure created;
- A web app page with a 3rd user where we can integrate for start various Python codes which can run various scripts on the datasets created in order to correct or interpret the data (in datasets).
- A web app page version of the form creation page where we can integrate this with an API or ML which will help the user create the forms better based on suggestions or datasets we feed to the ML script or API.

Design inspiration: check Slack, Miro - we like this.

We don't have a mockup or wireframe yet - based on the above please feel free to build the design you like - in order to be modern however to have the above functionalities included.

